{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "label": "Rebalance", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Intentionally conservative: buffered messages wait for HandOffComplete before forwarding to the new owner, so nothing races past a half-moved entity."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoff", "label": "HandOff directive", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoffcomplete", "label": "HandOffComplete", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance_triggers", "label": "Three rebalance triggers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Membership-driven, strategy-driven every rebalanceIntervalMs, and a region stopping. The first two feed the handoff protocol; the third does not, because the region is already gone."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_region_stopping", "label": "A region stopping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without this path a stopped region left its shards orphaned: the coordinator kept naming it as their home, senders cached it and delivered into a stopped actor, and nothing recovered it \u2014 the candidate set is derived from the registry with no liveness check, so the rebalance tick saw a balanced cluster. The notification is best-effort and idempotent."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_directive_authorization", "label": "Only the coordinator may order a handoff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The frame must arrive through the region envelope route, stamped with the peer the connection was authenticated as \u2014 never a field out of the payload \u2014 and that peer must be the node the region believes hosts the coordinator. Until this rule existed any peer that could complete the handshake could take a shard's entities down repeatably. This is authorization, not authentication: run mTLS if the network is not trusted."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_ownership_check", "label": "Ownership and once-only handoff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A HandOff already being acted on, or one naming a shard that lives elsewhere, is ignored \u2014 previously such a frame still emptied cached shard-home entries, so a duplicate or late directive cost every other node an extra round trip. Ownership is judged by allocation, not by whether the shard actor happens to be running."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handofftimeoutms", "label": "handOffTimeoutMs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The fallback for the coordinator and a region disagreeing about ownership: force-reallocate rather than wait forever."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalanceintervalms", "label": "rebalanceIntervalMs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_force_reallocation", "label": "Force-reallocation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Causes are a postStop that hangs or a network partition during handoff; mitigate by keeping postStop short and tuning handOffTimeoutMs to worst-case persist time plus buffer."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_split_brain_entities", "label": "Split-brain entities", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After a forced reallocation the old entities may still be alive on the source node and still receive messages locally, until the orphans die."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_buffered_messages", "label": "Buffered messages during handoff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A message sent during handoff is delayed, not dropped; the buffer is unbounded and drains on completion. The post-handoff re-ask matters more than it looks: completing a handoff clears the old cached shard home, and the coordinator announces a new placement only to the new owner and to regions with an outstanding query."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_work_shedding", "label": "Rebalance is work-shedding, not work-acquiring", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An idle node receives newly allocated shards but does not get existing shards moved into it just because it is quiet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_leastshardallocationstrategy", "label": "LeastShardAllocationStrategy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance_triggers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance_triggers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_region_stopping", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance_triggers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_leastshardallocationstrategy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance_triggers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalanceintervalms", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoff", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoffcomplete", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_directive_authorization", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_ownership_check", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handofftimeoutms", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_force_reallocation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_force_reallocation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_split_brain_entities", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_buffered_messages", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_buffered_messages", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handoffcomplete", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_work_shedding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_ownership_check", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_handofftimeoutms", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_rebalance", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_cluster_sharding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_rebalance_split_brain_entities", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_sharding_overview_coordinator", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/cluster/sharding/rebalance.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}